#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.desktop.in:7
#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Pixlay"
msgstr "Pixlay"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.desktop.in:8
msgid "Photo Collage"
msgstr "照片拼贴"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.desktop.in:14
msgid "collage;photo;grid;layout;mosaic;"
msgstr "拼贴;照片;网格;布局;马赛克;"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Pixlay lays photos out on a sheet: add one to nine of them, pick a layout, "
"frame each photo in its cell, give the collage a frame of its own and export "
"the finished image."
msgstr ""
"Pixlay 把照片摆在一张纸上：添加一到九张，选一种布局，为每个格子里的照片调整构"
"图，给整张拼贴加上边框，然后导出成品图。"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:27
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "功能："

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:29
msgid "Regular and irregular layouts for one to nine photos"
msgstr "一到九张照片的规则与不规则布局"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:30
msgid "Pan, zoom and arbitrary rotation for the photo in each cell"
msgstr "每个格子里的照片都能平移、缩放和任意角度旋转"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:31
msgid "A frame with its own gap, corner radius and colour"
msgstr "带间距、圆角和颜色的边框"

#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:32
msgid "Export to AVIF, PNG or JPEG at a long edge of your choice"
msgstr "按自选的长边像素数导出 AVIF、PNG 或 JPEG"

